{"seq":1,"slug":"copy-on-write","title":"写时复制：让共享既安全又便宜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/sharing/copy-on-write","wordCount":1353,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"写时复制-让共享既安全又便宜\">写时复制：让共享既安全又便宜</h1><p>分页最漂亮的副产品是共享几乎不要钱：既然序列通过块表间接寻址，让两个序列共用同一份 KV，只需让两张块表指向同一个物理块。但共享带来一个立刻要回答的问题——如果两个序列共用一个块，其中一个要往里写新内容怎么办？直接写会污染另一个序列的历史。写时复制（Copy-on-Write, CoW）就是这个问题的经典答案，它同样是从操作系统 <code>fork()</code> 借来的老智慧。这一篇讲 CoW 这个底层机制本身，前缀共享与并行采样都建立在它之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-共享只读-写才复制\">核心概念：共享只读、写才复制</h2><p>CoW 的规则一句话就能说清：多个序列可以共享同一个物理块<strong>只要没人写它</strong>；一旦某个序列需要修改这个共享块，就先把它复制一份、改自己那份，原块留给别人不动。共享与安全的矛盾，被「推迟复制到真正要写的那一刻」化解——很多时候那一刻永远不来，复制就永远省下了。</p>\n<p>判断「要不要复制」靠的是块表篇讲过的引用计数 <code>ref_cnt</code>，见 <a href=\"../paging/block-tables\">块表与映射</a>。规则精确化为：当一个序列要写某个块时，检查该块的 <code>ref_cnt</code>。若为 1（独占），直接原地写；若大于 1（正被别人共享），触发复制——申请一个新物理块，把老块内容拷过去，把自己块表里的映射改指向新块，老块 <code>ref_cnt</code> 减一。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>写入块 </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo>:</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>原地写</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">ref_cnt</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>复制后写新块</mtext></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>if </mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">ref_cnt</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{写入块 } p: \\quad \\begin{cases} \\text{原地写} &amp; \\text{if } \\texttt{ref\\_cnt}(p) = 1 \\\\ \\text{复制后写新块} &amp; \\text{if } \\texttt{ref\\_cnt}(p) &gt; 1 \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">写入块</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">原地写</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">复制后写新块</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">ref_cnt</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">if </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">ref_cnt</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[序列 S 要写物理块 p] --&gt; B{ref_cnt of p}&#10;  B --&gt;|等于 1,独占| C[原地写入 p]&#10;  B --&gt;|大于 1,共享中| D[从块池取新块 p&#39;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[复制 p 内容到 p&#39;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[改 S 块表映射到 p&#39;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[p 的 ref_cnt 减一]&#10;  G --&gt; H[写入 p&#39;,不影响其他序列]\">flowchart TD\n  A[序列 S 要写物理块 p] --&gt; B{ref_cnt of p}\n  B --&gt;|等于 1,独占| C[原地写入 p]\n  B --&gt;|大于 1,共享中| D[从块池取新块 p']\n  D --&gt; E[复制 p 内容到 p']\n  E --&gt; F[改 S 块表映射到 p']\n  F --&gt; G[p 的 ref_cnt 减一]\n  G --&gt; H[写入 p',不影响其他序列]</pre><h2 id=\"块粒度-cow-的一个微妙之处\">块粒度：CoW 的一个微妙之处</h2><p>把这条规则写成代码，就是所有共享场景共用的那段核心逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def write_block(seq, logical_idx, kv):&#10;    phys = seq.block_table[logical_idx]&#10;    if ref_cnt[phys] &gt; 1:                 # 别人也在用 → 触发 CoW&#10;        new = pool.alloc()&#10;        copy(phys, new)                   # 只复制这一个块&#10;        seq.block_table[logical_idx] = new&#10;        ref_cnt[phys] -= 1&#10;        phys = new&#10;    write(phys, kv)                       # 此时独占，安全原地写\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> write_block</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(seq, logical_idx, kv):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    phys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seq.block_table[logical_idx]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref_cnt[phys] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:                 </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 别人也在用 → 触发 CoW</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        new </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool.alloc()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        copy(phys, new)                   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只复制这一个块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        seq.block_table[logical_idx] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ref_cnt[phys] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        phys </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    write(phys, kv)                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 此时独占，安全原地写</span></span></code></pre></div><p>和操作系统按页复制一样，CoW 的复制是<strong>按块</strong>发生的，不是整段。这带来一个重要性质：只有被写到的那个块会被复制，其余共享块继续共享。设想两个序列共享了前 10 个块（比如同一段 prompt），当其中一个开始生成、要写第 11 个块时，前 10 个块纹丝不动继续共享，只有新写的块归它独有。共享的「公共前缀」多长，就能省下多长的存储与计算。</p>\n<p>这里也藏着块大小的又一重影响。CoW 在块边界处偶尔会产生一次「部分块复制」——如果分叉恰好发生在某个块中间，那个跨越分叉点的块必须复制。块越小，这种边界复制涉及的数据越少，浪费越小；块越大，边界复制越肉疼。这与 <a href=\"../paging/kv-blocks\">KV 块与页</a> 里讲的块大小取舍一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么它对-llm-服务如此关键\">为什么它对 LLM 服务如此关键</h2><p>CoW 在通用操作系统里是个优化；在 LLM 服务里它近乎是刚需，因为「一个共同起点、多个分叉结局」是 LLM 负载的普遍形态。三种典型场景都直接吃 CoW 的红利：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>共同部分</th>\n<th>分叉点</th>\n<th>CoW 收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前缀共享</td>\n<td>系统提示 / few-shot</td>\n<td>各请求的用户输入</td>\n<td>系统提示只存一份、只算一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行采样</td>\n<td>同一 prompt</td>\n<td>多个采样输出</td>\n<td>prompt 块 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 路共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Beam search</td>\n<td>prompt + 公共前缀</td>\n<td>各候选束的后续</td>\n<td>束间共享公共历史</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这三者分别是后两篇的主题，见 <a href=\"prefix-sharing\">前缀共享 (系统提示)</a> 与 <a href=\"parallel-sampling\">并行采样与 beam</a>。它们的共同底座就是这里的 CoW：先大方共享，写到分叉处再各自复制。没有 CoW，要么共享不安全，要么根本不敢共享，分页省下的内存也就用不到共享这个最赚的场景上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收益的量化直觉\">收益的量化直觉</h2><p>给一个数量感。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个序列共享一段 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 的公共前缀，不共享时这段前缀要存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 份、算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次；有了 CoW 共享，只存 1 份、算 1 次，直到有序列写到它才复制。前缀存储的节省率为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>节省</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>各自后续</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac><mtext>（当公共前缀主导时）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{节省} = \\frac{(n-1) \\cdot P}{n \\cdot P + (\\text{各自后续})} \\approx \\frac{n-1}{n} \\text{（当公共前缀主导时）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">节省</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">各自后续</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（当公共前缀主导时）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 很大、前缀很长（例如上千请求共享一段几百 token 的系统提示），节省逼近 100%。这正是前缀共享能把带同一系统提示的高并发服务成本压下来的根本原因，量化案例见 <a href=\"prefix-sharing\">前缀共享 (系统提示)</a>。CoW 让这份收益既能拿到、又不牺牲各序列独立演化的自由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CoW 规则：共享块只读时大家共用，谁要写谁先复制自己那份，原块留给他人。</li>\n<li>判断依据是引用计数 <code>ref_cnt</code>：为 1 原地写，大于 1 触发复制并改块表映射。</li>\n<li>复制按块粒度发生，只复制被写的块，其余共享块继续共享；块越小边界复制越省。</li>\n<li>LLM 负载普遍是「共同起点 + 多分叉」，CoW 让前缀共享、并行采样、beam search 都能安全共享。</li>\n<li>公共前缀主导时节省逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{n-1}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，高并发同系统提示场景收益接近 100%。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h3><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../paging/block-tables\">块表与映射</a> — CoW 依赖的引用计数机制</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"prefix-sharing\">前缀共享 (系统提示)</a> — CoW 在跨请求场景的应用</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"parallel-sampling\">并行采样与 beam</a> — CoW 在请求内多序列的应用</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../kv-cache-optimization/memory/prefix-sharing\">KV 缓存优化 · 前缀共享</a> — 共享机制的对照讲解</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"写时复制：让共享既安全又便宜","id":"写时复制-让共享既安全又便宜"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：共享只读、写才复制","id":"核心概念-共享只读-写才复制"},{"level":2,"text":"块粒度：CoW 的一个微妙之处","id":"块粒度-cow-的一个微妙之处"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么它对 LLM 服务如此关键","id":"为什么它对-llm-服务如此关键"},{"level":2,"text":"收益的量化直觉","id":"收益的量化直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"非连续 KV 存储：kernel 如何在碎片上算注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/paging/non-contiguous-kv"},"next":{"title":"前缀共享：一段系统提示只算一次","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/paged-attention-serving/sharing/prefix-sharing"}}